5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Since we are outgrowing our current layout, I think we should be thorough. I'd like to look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to make sure everyone is comfortable. I'll look into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm curious about how this actually affects our daily flow. I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times in the badge records. It's better to see the actual data before we start guessing who gets what.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to know how we interact. I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Does anyone else feel we are missing something? We have covered costs, comfort, logistics, and social dynamics, but I wonder if we should also consider the long-term flexibility of these choices.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think we are covering a lot! I'm just happy we are thinking about how it feels to sit there. @Victoria, do you think the costs will make it hard to change things later?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, that's exactly what I'm worried about. If we pick something that looks good on paper but ruins our morning rhythm or creates chaos every time someone joins, it's a waste of time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your ""rhythm"" is just a fancy word for convenience. Let's be honest: some of us will always be more inconvenienced than others. I want to see if the current plan just favors the early birds.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with @Shunichi that some people might be left out. I just hope we can find a way to make sure everyone feels like they belong, regardless of when they arrive.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we are all aligned on the categories of investigation. I will stick with my choices, as understanding the financial constraints is essential for a sustainable decision.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I'll stick with mine too. I really want to know about the noise and the chairs, because those things can make a whole day feel very different.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm sticking with my picks. I want to know exactly how much time we're losing to setup and shuffles. Efficiency isn't just about the layout; it's about the clock.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll keep my choices. If the survey shows people are miserable and the badge records show a huge gap in arrival times, we can't just pretend a ""fair"" layout exists without addressing those facts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll stay with my choices. I want to understand how sitting near each other actually helps us work and learn, so we don't accidentally lose that.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have a comprehensive plan. Let's proceed with these investigations so we can make a rational decision based on the evidence. I look forward to hearing what everyone discovers.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,Me too! I hope we find things that make everyone happy. I'll be waiting to see what you all find out!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"Let's get to it then. I'm ready to see if the ""pilot"" way of doing things is actually a dream or a nightmare for our schedules. See you all in the next round!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm satisfied with the distribution. Let's stop talking and start looking. I'll be interested to see if the data actually supports your hopes or just confirms my suspicions.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do my best to find something useful. I hope the information helps us make a choice that works for everyone. I'm looking forward to it.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
