60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Given the costs of re-wiring and the billing for floor area, Option A is the most fiscally responsible. It avoids the recurring expenses and chaos of frequent changes while providing the stability we need.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Option A. If we have fixed desks, I can finally get my chair and monitor just right without it being ruined, and we can make sure the noisy spots are handled fairly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is the only one that doesn't eat into my schedule. Free address is a time-sink, and rotating blocks just sounds like a scheduled version of those chaotic shuffles. I vote for A.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, @Minato, @May, you're all surprisingly agreeable. Option A is the only way to explicitly decide who sits where, ensuring the window seats aren't just claimed by the early birds. I vote for A.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Minato"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. Option A lets us intentionally place people who need to collaborate together, while still giving us the stability everyone else wants. It seems like the best way to keep our connections. I vote for A.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is rare that we reach a consensus so quickly, but the evidence is overwhelming. Option A addresses the budget, the physical comfort, the time constraints, and the need for fairness. I am satisfied.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm just glad we all agree! It makes me feel good that we're thinking about everyone's comfort and happiness. I'm happy to go with Option A.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,It's a relief we're on the same page. No more wasting my mornings on cable management or dreading a two-week shuffle. Let's just lock in Option A and get back to actual work.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's a rare moment of total agreement. As long as we actually discuss the seat assignments instead of letting the loudest person decide, Option A is the only rational choice. I'm in.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm glad we could all find a solution that works. I'll do my best to help us figure out the seating so everyone feels included. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"Since we have all expressed a clear preference for Option A, I believe we have reached a definitive conclusion. It is the most rational choice for our team's current needs and constraints.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
71,3,3,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm just so happy we could all agree on something that makes everyone feel okay. I'll be looking forward to getting my desk just right!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
73,3,3,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
74,3,3,talk,May,,I'm totally on board. Let's just make sure we don't spend another two weeks debating the actual map. Option A it is!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
75,3,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
76,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll make sure we don't fall back into old habits during the assignment phase. Let's keep this level of transparency. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
77,3,3,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
78,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm really glad we're doing this together. I'll support Option A and help make sure we're placed in a way that helps us all talk more.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
